  "value": "PalindromeStream() starts with an empty stream. track(c) appends the one-character string c. isPalindrome() returns true when the characters received so far, in order, read the same backwards (the empty stream counts as a palindrome), comparing characters exactly. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
